      <h1 id="prioritylevelconfiguration-flowcontrol-apiserver-k8s-io-v1" class="group scroll-mt-20">PriorityLevelConfiguration [flowcontrol.apiserver.k8s.io/v1]<a href="#prioritylevelconfiguration-flowcontrol-apiserver-k8s-io-v1" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h1>
      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold">Description</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>PriorityLevelConfiguration represents the configuration of a priority level.</p></dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold">Type</dt>
